  "question": {
    "text": "If the equilibrium constant of the reaction $2 \\mathrm{HI} \\rightleftharpoons \\mathrm{H}_{2}+\\mathrm{I}_{2}$ is $0.25,$ then the equilibrium constant for the reaction $\\mathrm{H}_{2}+\\mathrm{I}_{2} \\rightleftharpoons 2 \\mathrm{HI}$ would be",
